{
  "description": "The spec declares no error responses for 38 operations (messages, media, templates, Flows, groups, block users, commerce settings, calls, credit lines, business portfolio). Every one of them answers the Graph API error object on failure: a bogus node id (`1`) returned HTTP 400 with `{ error: { code: 100, type: \"GraphMethodException\" } }` on all 38 (live sweep, 2026-11-18, v23.0), so each gets BadRequest. On POST /{Phone-Number-ID}/messages a template name that does not exist returned HTTP 404 with code 132001 (`Template name does not exist in the translation`), and sending from a test number to a recipient outside its allowed list returned HTTP 400 with code 131030 (`Recipient phone number not in allowed list`), both live on 2026-11-18; sendMessage gets NotFound and the two coded classes TemplateNotFound and RecipientNotAllowed.",
  "patches": [
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/shapes/com.meta.whatsapp#RecipientNotAllowed",
      "value": {
        "type": "structure",
        "members": {
          "code": {
            "target": "smithy.api#Integer"
          },
          "message": {
            "target": "smithy.api#String"
          }
        },
        "traits": {
          "smithy.api#documentation": "The recipient is not in the test number's allowed list (Graph error 131030). Add it in the App Dashboard's API Setup before sending from a test number.",
          "smithy.api#error": "client",
          "smithy.api#httpError": 400,
          "com.distilled.openapi#errorMatchers": [
            {
              "status": 400,
              "code": 131030
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/shapes/com.meta.whatsapp#TemplateNotFound",
      "value": {
        "type": "structure",
        "members": {
          "code": {
            "target": "smithy.api#Integer"
          },
          "message": {
            "target": "smithy.api#String"
          }
        },
        "traits": {
          "smithy.api#documentation": "No approved template with this name exists in the requested language (Graph error 132001).",
          "smithy.api#error": "client",
          "smithy.api#httpError": 404,
          "com.distilled.openapi#errorMatchers": [
            {
              "status": 404,
              "code": 132001
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
